{"unit_id":"airainal__dsh-codex-mode#card-zh","repo":"airainal/dsh-codex-mode","commit":"787dfcdcda36fd3e43f0b14eedeb45d92b31a267","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Codex Mode for DeepSeek Harness 是面向 DSH Web 和 Desktop 的 Codex 执行模式扩展。它在权限菜单加入全局模式开关，并通过宿主端 step 驱动器，在工具调用前为没有文字说明的调用补充可见进度；当待办仍未完成且回复不是问题时，还会推动当前轮继续。模式状态保存在 profile，并应用于现有及新建的根会话，同时保留所选固定权限级别。用户也可以用 /codex-mode on 或 /codex-mode off 切换。适合希望 DSH 在多步任务执行时持续展示进展并接着完成待办的用户。需要 DSH 0.2.1-rc.x；不需额外 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:386-456","index.js:516-565","index.js:576-663","client.js:791-809"]}
{"unit_id":"airainal__dsh-codex-mode#card-en","repo":"airainal/dsh-codex-mode","commit":"787dfcdcda36fd3e43f0b14eedeb45d92b31a267","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Codex Mode for DeepSeek Harness adds Codex-style execution to DSH Web and Desktop. It shows progress before tool calls and continues turns with unfinished todos. Toggle it in the permission menu or with /codex-mode. Profile storage remembers the setting for root sessions.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:386-456","index.js:516-565","index.js:576-663","client.js:791-809"]}
